{c: Verse 1}
[E] [A],        Aji hamse bachkar kahan jaaiyega,
[E] [A],        Jahan jaaiyega hame paaiyega
[E],        Aji humse bachkar....
[B] [E] [A] [E],        Yeh kaisa nasha hai, yeh kaisa asar hai
[B] [E] [A] [E],        Na kabu me dil hai, na bas me najar hai
[B] [E],        Jara hosh aa le chale jayiyega
[B] [E],        Theher jayiyega Theher jayiyega
